@startuml
title GitForge V1.0.0 - AM-039 Repository Object Resolution
start
:Receive authorized repository read;
:Validate revision and path;
if (Input valid?) then (yes)
    :Resolve requested Git object;
    if (Object resolves?) then (yes)
